menu "MP65 attitude application"
    config MP65_ATTITUDE_STREAM
        bool "Stream attitude over native USB (UART console required)"
        default n
        help
            Emit quantized quaternion and ready channels through esp_stream
            at 25 Hz from Core 0. Owns native USB;
            cannot run alongside the capture transport or USB console.
            Acquisition never waits for USB. Uses a one-slot overwrite queue.
endmenu
